'' tiko c2t: every row of RFC-0001 section 5.5's macro table, the function-like refusals and the #if forms; --verify asserts each kept macro value with tiko's preprocessor.
'' Everything after the clang line is asserted byte for byte; the tiko and clang versions
'' in the banner depend on the host, so only the lines around them are.
'' TEST: cli
'' CLEAN: build/.c2t/macros
'' ARGS: c2t tests/c2t/src/macros.h --verify -o build/.c2t/macros/macros.ti
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 2
